; QSSC P0 -- L2 MIDDLE: TEOS ENTANGLEMENT BUS (64 NV sites, serial serpentine)
; GENERATED by tools/gen_qssc_gcode.py -- deterministic, auditable
; Stock: 20x20x1 mm glass wafer (the L2 layer) | tool: 1.0 mm flat end-mill
; spindle 8000 rpm | channel feed 80 mm/min | channel depth -0.5 mm
; VERTICAL STACK: L1 emitter BELOW this wafer / L3 detector ABOVE it.
; ENTANGLEMENT BUS: 8 horizontal runs + 7 vertical connectors = ONE continuous
; serpentine core threading all 64 NV sites (8x8, 2.5 mm pitch). 532 nm pump in
; at the LEFT facet (bus start); NV PL exits each site UP to L3. Serial bus ->
; all sites share one waveguide -> photons from different sites interfere.
; COORDS: carrier system. Die pocket (57.5,35)->(77.5,55), centred on carrier.
; WORK ZERO = carrier (0,0). Fixture the 20x20 L2 wafer with BL at (57.5,35),
; or set G56 X57.5 Y35 and run in wafer-local coords. Shared fiducials.
; Fill the whole bus with Ti-doped TEOS sol-gel + NV microdiamonds; densify 300 C.

G21 G90 G94 G17 G40 G49 G80   ; mm, abs, feed/min, XY plane, cancel comp
G0 Z10.0                       ; safe Z FIRST
M03 S8000                    ; spindle ON only after Z is safe

; -- shared carrier-corner fiducials (identical in every P0 file) --
